{"src":"en","tgt":"fa","rate":24000,"room_opened_ms_before":1500,"err":"","clip_ms":163000,"events":[{"kind":"hello","type":"hello","lang":"fa","src":"en","rate":24000,"mode":"utterance","edition":"nonprofit","context":true},{"kind":"input","t":7709.190930999999,"text":"If you have watched the movie National Treasure, you may think a treasure map was written on the back of the Declaration of Independence."},{"kind":"text","t":8706.785354,"text":"اگر فیلم گنج ملی را دیده باشید، ممکن است فکر کنید یک نقشه گنج پشت اعلامیه استقلال نوشته شده است."},{"kind":"audio","t":8859.041906,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":20,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":8863.697162,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":8868.868448,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1340},{"kind":"audio","t":8875.063685,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":20,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":8877.165757,"samples":15492,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":640},{"kind":"input","t":13887.493414999999,"text":"The hot chocolate is up to Belgian standards. Fruit juices are pricey, but after a while, you'll be able to taste the sweetness."},{"kind":"text","t":14834.432279,"text":"شکلات داغ مطابق با استانداردهای بلژیکی است. آبمیوه‌ها گران هستند، اما بعد از مدتی، می‌توانید شیرینی‌شان را حس کنید."},{"kind":"audio","t":14917.021868,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":10,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":14918.656668,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":14919.153009000001,"samples":5516,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":220},{"kind":"audio","t":14957.491812,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":20,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":14958.469163999998,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":20,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":14960.168282999999,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":14960.634115,"samples":16216,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":660},{"kind":"input","t":22222.347981,"text":"However, that is not true. Although there is something written on the back of the document, it is not a treasure map."},{"kind":"text","t":22884.858056,"text":"با این حال، این موضوع صحت ندارد. اگرچه چیزی پشت سند نوشته شده است، اما نقشه گنج نیست."},{"kind":"audio","t":22940.289679,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":30,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":22941.700103,"samples":17944,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":700},{"kind":"audio","t":22987.52034,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":22993.061499,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":22998.5208,"samples":28922,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1180},{"kind":"input","t":29991.254087,"text":"You may also wish to consult the advice of governments other than your own, but their advice is designed for their citizens."},{"kind":"text","t":31331.212285,"text":"شاید بخواهید با توصیه‌های دولت‌هایی غیر از دولت خودتان نیز مشورت کنید، اما توصیه‌های آن‌ها برای شهروندان خودشان طراحی شده است."},{"kind":"audio","t":31489.350680000003,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":10,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":31494.213762,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":31499.789840999998,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1340},{"kind":"audio","t":31504.711410999997,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":10,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":31510.149992,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":31515.436606000003,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":31515.795459,"samples":2619,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":100},{"kind":"input","t":41304.905946,"text":"Hong Kong Island gives the territory of Hong Kong its name and is a place that many tourists regard as the main focus."},{"kind":"text","t":42506.465031,"text":"جزیره هنگ کنگ نام این قلمرو را شکل داده است و مکانی است که بسیاری از گردشگران آن را به عنوان مرکز اصلی می‌شناسند."},{"kind":"audio","t":42677.796916,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":30,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":42682.817275,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":42688.182007,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":42693.381653,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":42698.48415,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":42701.405317,"samples":18668,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":770},{"kind":"input","t":49105.049194,"text":"Anyone who's going to drive at hot latitudes or over mountain passes should consider the possibility of snow, ice, or free"},{"kind":"text","t":50657.737355,"text":"هر کسی که قصد دارد در عرض‌های جغرافیایی گرم یا از گردنه‌های کوهستانی رانندگی کند، باید احتمال وجود برف، یخ یا یخ‌زدگی را در نظر بگیرد."},{"kind":"audio","t":50834.316435,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":20,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":50839.835313999996,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":50845.152047999996,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":50850.353093,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1220},{"kind":"audio","t":50855.670646,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":20,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":50860.667236,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":50862.934434,"samples":24074,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":940},{"kind":"input","t":58792.98125,"text":"Segregation and recombination shuffle variation back and forth between the two pools."},{"kind":"text","t":59610.110014,"text":"جداسازی و ترکیب مجدد، تنوع را بین این دو مجموعه جابه‌جا می‌کنند."},{"kind":"audio","t":59703.509816,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":40,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":59708.708162,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":59714.30016,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":59715.220323,"samples":8972,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":370},{"kind":"input","t":61183.883312,"text":"with each generation."},{"kind":"text","t":61400.012272,"text":"با هر نسل."},{"kind":"audio","t":61424.237712,"samples":18111,"rate":24000,"on":20,"off":690},{"kind":"input","t":66512.66809,"text":"The term bug is used by entomologists in a formal sense for this group of insects."},{"kind":"text","t":67566.98549199999,"text":"حشره‌شناسان واژه «bug» را در معنایی رسمی برای این گروه از حشرات به کار می‌برند."},{"kind":"audio","t":67657.186302,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":20,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":67662.080263,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":67667.405946,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":67670.465461,"samples":21232,"rate":24000,"on":40,"off":870},{"kind":"input","t":74700.884003,"text":"First, most riders wearing riding boots with a heel and a smooth, quite narrow sole."},{"kind":"text","t":75907.401287,"text":"در ابتدا، بیشتر سواران چکمه‌های سوارکاری با پاشنه و جدی صاف و نسبتاً باریک می‌پوشیدند."},{"kind":"audio","t":76019.719855,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":76024.791163,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":76030.006968,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":76035.40431,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1340},{"kind":"audio","t":76038.094551,"samples":18557,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":750},{"kind":"input","t":83922.521286,"text":"The commission was Martelli's response to widespread anti-regime protests that started in October."},{"kind":"text","t":84915.832967,"text":"این کمیسیون پاسخ مارتلی به اعتراضات گسترده ضد رژیم بود که از ماه اکتبر آغاز شده بود."},{"kind":"audio","t":85032.200032,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":100,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":85037.704191,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":85042.95170599999,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":85048.115362,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":85048.824749,"samples":7411,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":260},{"kind":"input","t":91144.632463,"text":"Fire rescue crews eventually doused the fire by 11.35pm."},{"kind":"text","t":92067.085782,"text":"نیروهای آتش‌نشانی سرانجام تا ساعت ۱۱:۳۵ شب آتش را خاموش کردند."},{"kind":"audio","t":92170.200887,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":20,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":92175.363714,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":92180.655247,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":92185.780054,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":92186.076379,"samples":1560,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":60},{"kind":"input","t":97376.827447,"text":"The tensioning storm of the Atlantic hurricane season, Subtropic Storm Jerry,"},{"kind":"text","t":98434.880661,"text":"طوفان پرتنش فصل هریکان اقیانوس اطلس، طوفان نیمه‌گرمسیری جری،"},{"kind":"audio","t":98530.998333,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":98536.14895,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":98541.570651,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":98543.623034,"samples":13151,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":540},{"kind":"input","t":100236.027629,"text":"formed in the Atlantic Ocean today."},{"kind":"text","t":100766.186222,"text":"امروز در اقیانوس اطلس شکل گرفت."},{"kind":"audio","t":100821.31992,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":100,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":100824.787076,"samples":23517,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":960},{"kind":"input","t":107239.97688,"text":"It has brought us to train the car and many other transportation devices."},{"kind":"text","t":108056.70022,"text":"این امر ما را به آموزش خودرو و بسیاری از وسایل حمل‌ونقل دیگر سوق داده است."},{"kind":"audio","t":108144.807917,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":20,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":108149.875853,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":108155.029328,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":108157.183388,"samples":13987,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":560},{"kind":"input","t":116624.08923,"text":"It's renowned for being an epicenter of luxury began in about 400 AD and lasted up a"},{"kind":"text","t":117619.901371,"text":"این مکان به عنوان مرکز تجمل و شکوهی شناخته می‌شود که از حدود سال ۴۰۰ میلادی آغاز شد و تا..."},{"kind":"audio","t":117743.390262,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":100,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":117748.313651,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":117753.619593,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":117758.798607,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":117762.960459,"samples":27473,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1080},{"kind":"input","t":120748.222343,"text":"until about 1100 A.D."},{"kind":"text","t":121212.431688,"text":"تا حدود سال ۱۱۰۰ میلادی ادامه داشت."},{"kind":"audio","t":121272.75536,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":30,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":121278.323106,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":121278.590991,"samples":3287,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":130},{"kind":"input","t":127072.859745,"text":"The surface of the moon is made of rocks and dust. The outer layer of the moon is called the crust."},{"kind":"text","t":127653.217048,"text":"سطح ماه از سنگ و گرد و غبار ساخته شده است. لایه بیرونی ماه پوسته نامیده می‌شود."},{"kind":"audio","t":127748.02533,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":127752.704573,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":127753.065807,"samples":4123,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":150},{"kind":"audio","t":127758.626064,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":20,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":127762.411133,"samples":24352,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1000},{"kind":"input","t":134217.41497,"text":"The U.S. Corps of Engineers estimated that six inches of rainfall could breach the previously damaged"},{"kind":"text","t":135449.89161400002,"text":"سپاه مهندسان ایالات متحده تخمین زد که شش اینچ بارش باران می‌تواند باعث شکاف در بخش‌هایی شود که پیش‌تر آسیب دیده بودند."},{"kind":"audio","t":135585.62675700002,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":135590.648354,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":135595.882367,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":135601.13196000003,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":135606.370563,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":135609.02182400002,"samples":18390,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":760},{"kind":"input","t":141191.39366600002,"text":"In particular, it is claimed that one can detect whether a person is lying by interpreting micro-expressions correctly."},{"kind":"text","t":142469.570692,"text":"به‌ویژه، ادعا می‌شود که می‌توان با تفسیر درست ریزبیان‌ها، تشخیص داد که آیا فردی در حال دروغ گفتن است یا خیر."},{"kind":"audio","t":142600.021994,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":20,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":142604.82323500002,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":142610.359303,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":142615.667144,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":142620.87887800002,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":142621.43510700003,"samples":8359,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":300},{"kind":"input","t":147238.280177,"text":"Do not deface the site by marking or scratching graffiti into structure."},{"kind":"text","t":148126.46187300002,"text":"با کشیدن گرافیتی یا خراش انداختن روی سازه، به سایت آسیب نزنید."},{"kind":"audio","t":148211.14397300003,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":20,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":148216.37283600002,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":148221.742157,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":148222.830867,"samples":9529,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":360},{"kind":"input","t":154876.60773800002,"text":"The tiger's roar is not like the full-voiced roar of a lion, but more like a sentence of snarly, shouted words."},{"kind":"text","t":156288.762611,"text":"غرش ببر شبیه به غرش رسا و بلند شیر نیست، بلکه بیشتر شبیه به جمله‌ای از کلمات فریادزده و خرناس‌مانند است."},{"kind":"audio","t":156428.766276,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":50,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":156433.67182500003,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":156438.81946000003,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":156444.155391,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":156449.438773,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":156453.137355,"samples":24520,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":960},{"kind":"input","t":161915.79205500003,"text":"20th century research has shown that there are two pools of genetic variation, hidden and expressed."},{"kind":"text","t":163088.06768500002,"text":"پژوهش‌های قرن بیستم نشان داده است که دو مجموعه از تنوع ژنتیکی وجود دارد: پنهان و آشکار."},{"kind":"audio","t":163198.52029800002,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":30,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":163203.514526,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":163208.74783900002,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1350},{"kind":"audio","t":163212.09163600003,"samples":22346,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":830},{"kind":"audio","t":163216.411196,"samples":26470,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1100},{"kind":"close","t":173303.33504900002,"code":1005}]}